            "en": "The source brief should contain only decisions the image must express: one subject and action, light with direction and quality, an optical point of view, a background relationship, and the frame shape. Add text-safe space only if it changes the composition. Leave out parameter flags, quality booster words, and tool-specific shorthand.",
            "zh": "源简报只包含画面必须表达的决定：一个主体和一个动作，光线的方向与性质，一种光学视角，背景关系，以及画幅。只有当留白会改变构图时，才写入“右侧留给标题”之类的限制。这个阶段不要放参数、质量咒语或工具专属缩写。"
