            "en": "Run the same brief through all three tools at the same aspect ratio. Change only the prompt dialect. Generate more than one result per tool, because a single sample is a coin toss, and judge each against fixed criteria: Is the subject doing the right action? Is the light coming from the stated side? Is the pot in front of the shelves? Does the frame leave the space you asked for? A beautiful image that loses the sink or turns the bowl into a vase has failed the brief.",
