            "en": "Write lighting as one clause with four slots in a fixed order: source and size, direction and height, quality and falloff, then what fills the shadow. A stable order makes prompts comparable. When an image misses, you change one slot and you know what moved.",
            "zh": "把布光写成一句话，四个位置按固定顺序填：光源与大小、方向与高度、光质与衰减、暗部用什么补。顺序固定，提示词之间才可比较——图不对时，你只改一格，就知道是哪一格起了作用。"
