            "en": "The adapted version names each slot: \"Write a short product recommendation post for Xiaohongshu (RED), first person, 150 to 250 words. Audience: women aged 20 to 30 shopping for skincare. Tone: lively and conversational, like a friend texting. Avoid hard-sell claims, discount language and superlatives.\" Same request, same intent, far more control. Note what the adaptation made explicit: the vague \"not too advertisement\" became two named prohibitions, and the word count and reader came from context the original writer assumed was shared.",
