            "en": "The reverse direction has the same problem. \"Punchy\" in an English brief might mean short sentences, strong verbs or a bold visual, so say which one you mean. \"Actionable\" is often better rendered as 具体可执行 than as 可操作. When a word has no equivalent, do not import it. Describe the evidence a reader would see if the quality were present.",
